So, the Time required is calculated as follows:

Time = Distance / Speed
     = 225,000,000 kilometers / 800 kilometers per hour
     = 281,250 hours

This calculation gives us the time in hours, but it is often more intuitive to think of long durations in terms of days. To do this conversion, we use the fact that there are 24 hours in a single day. 

