Provide a detailed explanation of how a wind turbine can be used to generate renewable energy. Your explanation should include [diagrams in Latex] to illustrate the process and [Python code] to simulate wind turbine power generation. Additionally, discuss the advantages and limitations of using wind turbines for renewable energy generation.
    
