4. `translate(dx, dy)`: This method should take in the values dx and dy and translate the circle by moving its center coordinates by dx units along the x-axis and dy units along the y-axis.

Note: The circle should be defined as a filled circle, meaning that any point on or inside the circumference of the circle is considered to be inside the circle.
    
